<main class="page">
<section class="gallery-hero"><div class="container gallery-hero__inner"><div class="gallery-hero__title"><h1 data-revel-text="up split=words">[[Des objets à tourner dans tous les sens.||Objects to turn every which way.]]</h1></div><p class="lead" data-revel-appear="up delay=0.2">[[Choisissez un modèle, faites-le tourner, comparez ses matières calque par calque.||Pick a model, turn it, compare its materials layer by layer.]]</p></div></section>
<section class="section section--tight"><div class="container"><div class="filters" data-revel-filters="categorie"><button class="filter" type="button" data-revel-filter="">[[Tous||All]]</button><button class="filter" type="button" data-revel-filter="[[Objets||Objects]]">[[Objets||Objects]]</button><button class="filter" type="button" data-revel-filter="[[Mobilier||Furniture]]">[[Mobilier||Furniture]]</button><button class="filter" type="button" data-revel-filter="[[Luminaires||Lighting]]">[[Luminaires||Lighting]]</button><button class="filter" type="button" data-revel-filter="[[Mode||Fashion]]">[[Mode||Fashion]]</button></div><div class="models">{% for item in collections.models %}<div class="models__item" data-revel-tags="{{ item.data.category }}"><x-use c="model-card" x-image="item.data.poster" x-title="item.data.title" x-category="item.data.category" x-link="item.url"></x-use></div>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
</main>
